=== Episode 4: Dairy ===
For the signature challenge this week, Paul and Prue tasked the bakers with a dairy cake, but the cake mixture needed to contain a [[cultured dairy product]], to be done in 2 hours and 15 minutes. For the technical challenge, Prue asked the bakers to make a difficult bake that dated back to the [[Tudor period|Tudor]] times, 12 [[Maids of honour tart|Maids of Honours]], in 2 hours. For the showstopper challenge, the judges gave the bakers the task of making a display of milk-based Indian [[sweets]] known as [[Bengali cuisine#Dessert|Mishti]], in {{frac|3|1|2}} hours.{{sticky header}}{{table alignment}}
