=== Episode 9: Pâtisserie (Semifinal) ===
For the signature challenge, the bakers had {{frac|2|1|2}} hours to make 8 identically decorated domed tarts. Prue's technical challenge was making a [[Gâteau Saint Honoré]], a French classic involving both [[Choux pastry|choux]] and [[Puff pastry|puff]] pastry, plus a large amount of cream fillings, all in {{frac|3|1|2}} hours. For the showstopper challenge, the bakers were given the difficult task of making a sugar glass display case, enclosing a display of [[pâtisserie]] or other lavish baked goods, in {{frac|4|1|2}} hours.{{table alignment}}
